# 5. SKIP DAY PROCESS

Ketika Master melakukan Skip Day:

```text
STEP 01
Master confirms Skip

        ↓

STEP 02
System checks current state

        ↓

STEP 03
Time System advances

        ↓

STEP 04
All connected systems simulate activity

        ↓

STEP 05
RNG events are processed

        ↓

STEP 06
Daily Reset is executed

        ↓

STEP 07
All system states are updated

        ↓

STEP 08
Game State calculates and validates changes

        ↓

STEP 09
Database synchronization

        ↓

STEP 10
AI Fairy generates mandatory daily report

        ↓

STEP 11
New Day begins
```

---

# 6. PRE-SKIP VALIDATION

Sebelum Skip Day dimulai, sistem melakukan pemeriksaan.

```text
SKIP DAY REQUEST
       ↓
VALIDATION
       │
       ├── Active Mission?
       ├── Active Combat?
       ├── Active Raid?
       ├── Critical Event?
       ├── Story Event?
       ├── Hero Condition?
       ├── Town Activity?
       ├── Dungeon State?
       ├── World Exploration?
       └── Other Restrictions?
```

Jika kondisi tertentu tidak mengizinkan Skip:

```text
SKIP DENIED
```

Fairy memberikan alasan kepada Master.

Contoh:

> **Fairy:**
> "Master, Skip Day cannot be activated while the current Raid is still in progress."

Jika Skip diizinkan:

```text
SKIP APPROVED
   ↓
TIME SIMULATION STARTED
```

